# Generated ts-rs bindings are written with LF (issue #359). Pin them to LF so
# the CI drift gate (`git diff --exit-code src/types/generated`) never trips on
# a CRLF/LF mismatch on Windows runners where core.autocrlf may be enabled.
# The harness catalog JSON snapshot (ADR-0037) is emitted by the same cargo
# test pass and must stay LF for the same reason.
src/types/generated/*.ts text eol=lf
src/types/generated/*.json text eol=lf
